{'symbol': 'LYB', 'date': '2023-03-13 05:43:00', 'title': 'LYONDELLBASELL ANNOUNCES DECISION TO ACQUIRE MEPOL GROUP', 'text': 'FACILITIES IN POLAND AND ITALY WILL PRODUCE RECYCLED AND POLYMER COMPOUNDS FOR DIVERSE MARKETS ROTTERDAM, NETHERLANDS AND FERRARA, ITALY , MARCH 13, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0LYONDELLBASELL (NYSE: LYB) AND MEPOL GROUP TODAY\xa0ANNOUNCED THEY HAVE ENTERED INTO A DEFINITIVE AGREEMENT FOR LYONDELLBASELL TO ACQUIRE MEPOL GROUP, A MANUFACTURER OF RECYCLED, HIGH-PERFORMING TECHNICAL COMPOUNDS LOCATED IN ITALY AND POLAND, CONSISTING OF MEPOL S.R.L. AND ITS SUBSIDIARIES POLAR S.R.L.'}